6x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/iric-2-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/div>\n\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__text\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-post__title\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/partnership\/\" >\n\t\t\t\tIRIC\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__meta-data\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-post-date\">\n\t\t\tMarch 5, 2024\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-post-avatar\">\n\t\t\tNo Comments\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__excerpt\">\n\t\t\t<p>The IRIC Community connects researchers from all over the world and facilitates the presentation of ideas as well find as find partners to collaborate with on new research interfaces. <\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__read-more\" href=\"https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/partnership\/\" aria-label=\"Read more about IRIC\" tabindex=\"-1\" >\n\t\t\tRead More \u00bb\t\t<\/a>\n\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/article>\n\t\t\t\t<article class=\"elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-158 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-uncategorized\">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__thumbnail__link\" href=\"https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/graduation\/\" tabindex=\"-1\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__thumbnail\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/WhatsApp-Image-2024-01-12-at-15.51.26_2c4835d9-300x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-31\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/WhatsApp-Image-2024-01-12-at-15.51.26_2c4835d9-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/WhatsApp-Image-2024-01-12-at-15.51.26_2c4835d9-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/WhatsApp-Image-2024-01-12-at-15.51.26_2c4835d9.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/div>\n\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__text\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-post__title\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/graduation\/\" >\n\t\t\t\tKNUST Officials&#8217; Week-Long Visit to Affiliate Institutions, Including AIT in Greater Accra Region.\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__meta-data\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-post-date\">\n\t\t\tMarch 5, 2024\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-post-avatar\">\n\t\t\tNo Comments\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__excerpt\">\n\t\t\t<p>The ties that bind the Accra Institute of Technology (AIT) and Kwame Nkrumah University of Science and Technology (KNUST) have always been well-known. KNUST, globally recognized for its academic prowess, has been a steadfast partner to AIT.<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__read-more\" href=\"https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/graduation\/\" aria-label=\"Read more about KNUST Officials&#8217; Week-Long Visit to Affiliate Institutions, Including AIT in Greater Accra Region.\" tabindex=\"-1\" >\n\t\t\tRead More \u00bb\t\t<\/a>\n\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/article>\n\t\t\t\t<article class=\"elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-155 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-uncategorized\">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__thumbnail__link\" href=\"https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/polar-dears\/\" tabindex=\"-1\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__thumbnail\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" src=\"https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2024-01-12-at-15.51.26_725c00ae-300x169.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-146\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2024-01-12-at-15.51.26_725c00ae-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2024-01-12-at-15.51.26_725c00ae-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2024-01-12-at-15.51.26_725c00ae.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/div>\n\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__text\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-post__title\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/polar-dears\/\" >\n\t\t\t\tAIT EXPO\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__meta-data\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-post-date\">\n\t\t\tMarch 5, 2024\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-post-avatar\">\n\t\t\tNo Comments\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-post__excerpt\">\n\t\t\t<p>The National Science and Technology Expo is an annual event organized in the fourth quarter of the year principally for the Accra Institute of Technology students to showcase their capstone projects to the public.<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<a class=\"elementor-post__read-more\" href=\"https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/polar-dears\/\" aria-label=\"Read more about AIT EXPO\" tabindex=\"-1\" >\n\t\t\tRead More \u00bb\t\t<\/a>\n\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/article>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>News and Events<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"site-sidebar-layout":"no-sidebar","site-content-layout":"","ast-site-content-layout":"full-width-container","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-header-display":"","ast-hfb-mobile-header-display":"","site-post-title":"disabled","ast-breadcrumbs-content":"","ast-featured-img":"disabled","footer-sml-layout":"","theme-transparent-header-meta":"","adv-header-id-meta":"","stick-header-meta":"","h